OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start with patches of
OL,6,Ffrost or fog possible in prone rural
OL,7,Fareas. Cloudiest in the northeast,
OL,8,Fwith the best bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Ffurther south. Scattered coastal
OL,10,Fshowers throughout the day, spreading
OL,11,Fto hills during the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FScattered coastal showers
OL,14,Fwill come and go, but remaining dry
OL,15,Finland. Clear spells in the south
OL,16,Funder which frost and fog will
OL,17,Fdevelop. Cold and cloudy further north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
