OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FFog will lift through the
OL,6,Fmorning to bring long spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. Slightly cloudier further
OL,8,Fnorth, but for all it will feel cool,
OL,9,Fcalm and autumnal.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,12,Ffoggy, frosty and bright morning on
OL,13,FMonday, before cloud thickens. Cloudy
OL,14,Fand breezy with spells of rain during
OL,15,FTuesday and Wednesday, but
OL,16,Ftemperatures will be milder than
OL,17,Fprevious days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
